// MISTAKE: an employer before the name of a 529 plan. A 529 is a taxpayer's account (a person or a household), so `acme` is no
// owner of it: the word fits no slot, where it used to be placed as the owner without a word said.
base USD
use std
use us/529

entity acme : employer
entity riley : person

account acme/529 : 529-plan
  beneficiary riley

opening 2026-01-01
  acme/529 5_000 USD
